            (the trap decode), tools/rc2cfg.py, tools/rcdiff.py.  All ran on tb277 through
            tools/tb.

  Note on the decode.  `--values` is required for this case.  A linkDown trap and a linkUp
  trap carry byte-identical varbind OIDs: ifIndex, ifAdminStatus and ifOperStatus, at the
  same instance.  Only the VALUE of `snmpTrapOID.0` tells them apart
  (1.3.6.1.6.3.1.1.5.3 against 1.3.6.1.6.3.1.1.5.4).  Decoding OIDs alone cannot.

